{"title":"Isabelle Li","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Isabelle Li","page-layout":"full","format":{"html":{"toc":false}}},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"page-body\">\n<div class=\"dashboard\">\n\n  <!-- ══ Card 1 — Intro (3-col: bio | photo | skills) ══ -->\n  <div class=\"hero-card\">\n\n    <div class=\"hc-bio\">\n      <h1 class=\"hero-name\">Isabelle Li</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Master's Student in Urban Spatial Analytics<br>at the University of Pennsylvania</p>\n      <p class=\"hero-bio\">Spatial analytics student at Penn with a background in mathematics and economics. Focused on <strong>how data informs real-world decisions</strong> — from building spatial models and analytical pipelines to designing <strong>user-facing tools</strong> that turn complex data into clear, actionable insights.</p>\n      <div class=\"social-links\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:isabli@upenn.edu\" title=\"Email\" aria-label=\"Email\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-envelope-fill\"></i>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isabellelii\" title=\"LinkedIn\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/Isabelliiii\" title=\"GitHub\" aria-label=\"GitHub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hc-photo\">\n      <img src=\"photo.jpg\" class=\"profile-photo-hero\" alt=\"Isabelle Li\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hc-skills\">\n      <p class=\"skills-label\">Skills &amp; Tools</p>\n      <div class=\"skills-grid\">\n        <div class=\"skill-chip\"><span class=\"skill-icon-wrap\"><i class=\"bi bi-pin-map-fill\"></i></span><span>GIS (ArcGIS, QGIS)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"skill-chip\"><span class=\"skill-icon-wrap\"><i class=\"bi bi-cpu-fill\"></i></span><span>Machine Learning</span></div>\n        <div class=